MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_001: Ah, perfect day for a walk! Huh? What's this?
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_002: Oh! What pretty lipstick! But this must belong to\nsomeone...I think?
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_003: Oh, sorry about that. It's mine.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_004: It is? I guess I knew guys in the circus who'd wear\nmakeup sometimes for performances.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_005: But I can't imagine you wearing this, Nezha. That's\nkinda surprising to me.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_006: Nah, I'm not using it. It doesn't really help with my\nmartial-arts training or anything.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_007: Then why do you have it? Was it a gift for someone?
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_008: No, nothing like that! Some lady from the village\ngave it to me, just before I set out.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_009: Oh, I see! A gift for you to take on your journey!\nWere you two close?
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_010: We were just acquaintances. I'd only talked to her a\nfew times when I helped her get water.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_011: Though she did say that if anyone approached me\nduring my travels, I should show them the lipstick.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_012: Oh!
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_013: What a weird thing, huh? I mean, showing an enemy\nlipstick isn't as effective as punching 'em in the face.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_014: Ehehe... Well, flirting and attacking are two\ndifferent things...
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_015: I mean, the lipstick is probably meant to shoo other\npeople away so they don't hit on Nezha...
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_016: Hm, I wonder if I should explain it to him... But I\nalso don't feel like it's my place to say.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_017: What's wrong? You think I could use it as a\nweapon somehow?
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_018: No, no, of course not! Lipstick's not for battle...
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_019: Damn, I was really hoping. Oh well.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_020: Anyway, I've got no use for it, so you should take it!
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_021: No way! That's not for me! You need to take good\ncare of it.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_022: What is with you? No need to freak out.
MID_SE_Naz_Hal_C_023: Maybe you don't know much about things like this...\nI guess it's on me to teach you!
